          "For full credit, also analyze the closing exchange ('You don't have to keep coming out here' / 'I know... and kept working') as the passage's clearest statement of its theme — Wren's continued action, not her words, becomes the real answer to her grandfather's implicit question, echoing the passage's earlier privileging of action over explicit statement."
